仅是不能把指数一概而论了，板块里面都得细分出来分析。</span></font></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100002898\" data-ratio=\"0.57\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLzdxBQXugVV7nsF0TALrtTaibxthsaqUf5lb09dCHGsbkC7WkSGxUL8gpDpCcWp0xbEtKv7zVSGw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"800\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">像军工、商业航天啊</span>，都是下跌反弹不破高之后，这个位置一笔下跌，微破低点，所以现在第一，很多板块上涨趋势结束了，要么是转成震荡，要么转成小波段下跌趋势。</span></font></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100002899\" data-ratio=\"0.5654320987654321\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLzdxBQXugVV7nsF0TALrtxcEYOhNBPiaGtVQe2ICyBxyQ6HicxVZBuibUXQx97CcsQLPsWMLNbSWqA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"810\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">但还有一些板块</span>，像钢铁是上涨趋势破高点，回调今天低点已经非常接近颈线了，像煤炭今天冲高回落，但也是大小级别都是上涨波段，如果回调这个位置还是</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><span leaf=\"\">w底颈线。</span></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100002900\" data-ratio=\"0.562807881773399\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLzdxBQXugVV7nsF0TALrtOwEBfETxyHB7aRm9yjuHgXJBwzbI0fm1aqVGjcAghVLcaI2CAxfg9g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"812\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">同时呢银行，</span>这是港股的银行叠加</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><span leaf=\"\">a股的银行，港股银行是不断创新高的，尤其是四大行，但a股银行最近出现了下跌，是一个明显的反向</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">。</span></font></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100002901\" data-ratio=\"0.5684340320591862\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLzdxBQXugVV7nsF0TALrtd2y3z6TFaicGXIwjmzOt49vgBGWC41v4hr1UUZdsttMVQz8fibDuOxlQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"811\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">在之前的走势都差不多的情况之下</span>，最近一个月出现了这么大的一个分化，大概率是跟神秘资金压盘有关</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">。</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">那么它一个本来就该涨的板块</span>，被某些资金强行压着，那一旦这个资金不压的话，它是不是也会反弹的比较高呢？</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">而且</span></span></font><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">a股银行的大波段本身也是上涨趋势</span>，四大行也好，里面一些个股也好，低点是都没被破坏的，只是短线走势比较弱而已。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">那么在高股息板块都是上涨趋势</span>，银行也有底部迹象的情况之下，再加上上证</span></font><span leaf=\"\">50下方空间不大，个人建议，短线还是往高股息板块上去靠。</span></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">那么中长线呢，我们昨天也分析了</span>，像白酒、消费、医药这些，都是有主力进场迹象，但是以底部的第一根大阳线的拉升，往往先会有回调。</span></font></span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100002902\" data-ratio=\"0.5700123915737298\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/szVAj3XrnMOLzdxBQXugVV7nsF0TALrtic8okWoFOy7oPT2YMblI4xnIgTWdsnHW6iaoXuov5VWRg7gO5ibzFoCpw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"807\" type=\"block\"/></section><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">包括房地产等等传统板块</span>，应该是一个先回调震荡，等缩量，或者说大盘大跌的时候，</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">把</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">它们也给带下去，等大盘见底的时候，它们也见底同涨</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">。</span></font></span><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">但</span></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;text-decoration: underline;\" textstyle=\"\">这个时间大概率可能要在年后了。</span></span></font></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">这个是以中长线和年后的布局</span>，方向是消费、白酒、医药，甚至光伏、化工、农业、房地产等传统板块。</span></font></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 8pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">刘广义</span></font><font face=\"Calibri\"><span leaf=\"\">A0630624060004</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">上海凯石证券投资咨询有限公</span></font></span></p><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" style=\"line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 8pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">投资有风险</span></font><span leaf=\"\"> </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">入市需谨慎个人观点</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">仅供参考</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">案例截图</span></font><span leaf=\"\">  </span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">不做投资依据</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 8pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;margin-bottom: 8px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;font-size: 8pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\">上海凯石证券投资咨询有限公司</span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;font-size: 8pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"margin-right: 0pt;margin-left: 0pt;padding: 0pt;text-indent: 2em;margin-bottom: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-size: 12pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p></div>",
